Subject: [PATCH 11/11] radeon_hd: debug output for DCE 10+ bring-up

* Dump the non-zero display registers before and after the mode set in
  the same format as Linux amdgpu register captures.
* Trace the encoder mode chosen on mode set.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NqrEBcidivS5BSWVfbLqvu
